TEXT -704 720 Left 2 ;Oscillator start-up: one cross-coupled SN74HC240 LC oscillator, parts as in hardware/schematic (oscillator p2, coupler).
TEXT -704 760 Left 2 ;X1/X2: HC240 inverters (hcinv: push-pull, Rout each way, tanh threshold midway between vcc and its gnd, input lag td; in osc.lib). R1/R2: 1k, open until SW1 enables the outputs at Ton.
TEXT -704 688 Left 2 ;Rloss: lumped tank loss beyond the inductor ESR (couplers, probe, comparator), fitted to A_L with only its probe connected (0.31-2.98 V, 2026-11-03).
TEXT -704 792 Left 2 ;Node loads: Chc = HC240 Ci (3p typ), Cwin = TLV3502 (2p), Cpot = one MCP4351 terminal (estimate), Cprobe/Rprobe = 10x probe on l. The probe is the start-up asymmetry.
TEXT -704 832 Left 2 ;g: HC240 GND pin = SYNC net: R12 || L12 (L1 on the coupler board) to the plane, C12 to J8 (Rj8 = 1G open, 50 for a generator). Csync is the net's pin/trace capacitance (not drawn).
TEXT -704 976 Left 2 ;Ct = 723p fits A (free-running 1.044 MHz, A_L probe only, with td = 40n, inside the 750p part's 5%). td: ~40 ns from the switching kinks on A_L (2.0 V rising, 1.3 V falling).
TEXT -704 864 Left 2 ;Supply: Vreg = Feather 3V3, Ccoupler = C13 + C14 + ten 100n, Rsup + Lsup = traces and J1 (estimates), Cosc = six 100n on the oscillator board.
TEXT -704 904 Left 2 ;Nshare: oscillators sharing the ground and supply parts in phase (series parts x Nshare, capacitors / Nshare).
TEXT -704 936 Left 2 !.include osc.lib
TEXT -704 1120 Left 2 !.param Lt=29.95u Q=40 Ct=723p Rs=1k Rout=60 Vcc=3.3 gain=30 td=40n Ton=5u Nshare=1 Rloss=9k
TEXT -704 1152 Left 2 !.param Chc=3p Cwin=2p Cpot=10p Cprobe=12p Csync=100p Rj8=1G Rsup=0.1 Lsup=100n
TEXT -704 1224 Left 2 !.tran 0 300u 0 2n
TEXT -704 1264 Left 2 !.meas tran t1 when V(l,r)=0 rise=40
TEXT -704 1296 Left 2 !.meas tran t2 when V(l,r)=0 rise=50
TEXT -704 1336 Left 2 !.meas tran freq param 10/(t2-t1)
TEXT -704 1368 Left 2 !.meas tran vmin min V(l) from 40u to 60u
TEXT -704 1408 Left 2 !.meas tran vmax max V(l) from 40u to 60u
TEXT -704 1440 Left 2 !.meas tran vpp param vmax-vmin
TEXT -704 1480 Left 2 !.meas tran tstart when V(l,r)=1 rise=1
TEXT -704 1512 Left 2 !.meas tran startup param tstart-Ton
TEXT -704 1552 Left 2 !.meas tran tfull when V(l,r)=2.1 rise=1
TEXT -704 1584 Left 2 !.meas tran full param tfull-Ton
TEXT -704 1624 Left 2 !.meas tran gpp pp V(g) from 40u to 60u
TEXT -704 1656 Left 2 !.meas tran vccmin min V(vcc) from 5u to 60u
